WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.941 --> 00:00:13.442
and his teenage cousin walked into the farmyard.

2
00:00:13.462 --> 00:00:17.665
"See you later, Drew," Bobby said.

3
00:00:18.745 --> 00:00:19.526
Drew grinned.

4
00:00:19.546 --> 00:00:22.607
"Be ready for Big Splashdown!"

5
00:00:23.888 --> 00:00:25.969
Bobby looked nervous as he waved good-bye.

6
00:00:25.989 --> 00:00:31.032
"What's Big Splashdown?"

7
00:00:31.484 --> 00:00:32.284
Nina asked.

8
00:00:32.305 --> 00:00:38.067
"My cousin is taking me to a waterpark this afternoon," Bobby said.

9
00:00:38.087 --> 00:00:40.809
"But we won't go if it rains."

10
00:00:42.349 --> 00:00:43.930
Everyone looked at the blue sky.

11
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.692
"There's not a cloud anywhere!"

12
00:00:47.712 --> 00:00:48.932
Izzie said.

13
00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:52.674
"The weather changes fast sometimes.

14
00:00:52.694 --> 00:00:56.136
It could rain," Bobby said.

15
00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.701
The kids went inside and washed their hands.

16
00:01:05.002 --> 00:01:07.083
A basket of blueberries sat on the counter.

17
00:01:08.764 --> 00:01:10.084
Chef pointed to the screen.

18
00:01:10.104 --> 00:01:12.445
"Here's today's recipe."

19
00:01:14.126 --> 00:01:15.046
Nina smiled.

20
00:01:15.066 --> 00:01:19.628
"Yum! Lemon blueberry muffins."

21
00:01:21.709 --> 00:01:22.990
Jason put on his apron.

22
00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:29.964
"Bobby, you don't sound too excited about the waterpark."

23
00:01:29.984 --> 00:01:30.705
Bobby frowned.

24
00:01:30.725 --> 00:01:34.927
"Drew wants to go down Mount Olympus waterslide.

25
00:01:35.988 --> 00:01:37.989
It's the highest slide in the park."

26
00:01:38.009 --> 00:01:43.293
"Don't go down the slide if you're scared," Izzie said.

27
00:01:43.313 --> 00:01:48.316
"If I don't, Drew will tease me," Bobby said.

28
00:01:48.336 --> 00:01:54.600
"Izzie, please preheat the oven to 190 degrees Celsius," Chef said.

29
00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:03.342
"I'll line the muffin cups," Nina said.

30
00:02:07.944 --> 00:02:09.085
She looked at the recipe.

31
00:02:09.105 --> 00:02:11.786
"What is zest?"

32
00:02:11.806 --> 00:02:17.549
"It's finely grated peel from citrus fruit," Chef said.

33
00:02:17.569 --> 00:02:20.391
"It adds an intense flavor.

34
00:02:21.552 --> 00:02:22.752
Bobby can zest the lemon."

35
00:02:24.533 --> 00:02:27.095
Chef showed him how to scrape the lemon against the grater.

36
00:02:27.115 --> 00:02:29.456
"Don't scrape the white part.

37
00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.441
It tastes bitter.

38
00:02:32.241 --> 00:02:33.842
Just scrape the yellow part."

39
00:02:35.683 --> 00:02:37.324
Bobby tried to do a good job.

40
00:02:38.405 --> 00:02:39.225
"Hey, Chef!"

41
00:02:39.845 --> 00:02:41.346
He suddenly had an idea.

42
00:02:41.366 --> 00:02:44.788
"I can stay after class if you need extra help!"

43
00:02:44.808 --> 00:02:48.190
"That's not necessary," Chef said.

44
00:02:49.191 --> 00:02:50.471
Bobby looked disappointed.

45
00:02:55.254 --> 00:02:58.036
Using the mixer, Jason combined the butter and sugar.

46
00:02:59.648 --> 00:03:01.209
Bobby added the lemon zest.

47
00:03:02.809 --> 00:03:05.290
Then Nina and Izzie added the egg and vanilla.

48
00:03:06.771 --> 00:03:08.432
Jason mixed everything together.

49
00:03:08.452 --> 00:03:14.474
"Now we combine these dry ingredients," Izzie said.

50
00:03:16.395 --> 00:03:19.396
Bobby measured two cups of flour and poured it into a bowl.

51
00:03:20.797 --> 00:03:22.698
Izzie sprinkled in a teaspoon of salt.

52
00:03:23.998 --> 00:03:28.040
Jason added two teaspoons of baking powder and whisked the ingredients together.

53
00:03:30.396 --> 00:03:35.138
"Next we add these dry ingredients to the butter mixture," Izzie said.

54
00:03:35.158 --> 00:03:39.600
"Yep. And then we add the milk," Nina said.

55
00:03:41.441 --> 00:03:43.262
Bobby added the dry ingredients.

56
00:03:44.382 --> 00:03:45.402
Nina added the milk.

57
00:03:47.283 --> 00:03:49.184
Jason mixed until the batter was thick.

58
00:03:49.204 --> 00:03:54.146
"I'll fold in the blueberries," Izzie said.

59
00:03:56.247 --> 00:03:58.288
She poured in the berries and gently stirred.

60
00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.542
The kids took turns filling the muffin cups with batter.

61
00:04:07.586 --> 00:04:09.147
Chef put the pan into the oven.

62
00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:14.012
Nina and Izzie went outside to feed the chickens.

63
00:04:16.013 --> 00:04:18.816
Bobby washed dishes, and Jason wiped the counters.

64
00:04:18.836 --> 00:04:24.521
"It's okay to be scared of the waterslide, Bobby," Jason said.

65
00:04:24.541 --> 00:04:27.764
"I bet your cousin is afraid of something too."

66
00:04:29.664 --> 00:04:30.865
Bobby thought for a minute.

67
00:04:30.885 --> 00:04:34.207
"Drew is afraid to talk to girls!"

68
00:04:35.989 --> 00:04:38.230
He and Jason laughed.

69
00:04:46.176 --> 00:04:48.478
The girls came inside when the muffins were ready.

70
00:04:50.159 --> 00:04:52.421
Bobby bit into a warm, delicious muffin.

71
00:04:52.441 --> 00:04:56.864
"Maybe I'll go down the waterslide, but maybe not."

72
00:04:58.344 --> 00:04:59.986
"What if Drew teases you?"

73
00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:01.207
Jason asked.

74
00:05:02.128 --> 00:05:02.988
Bobby grinned.

75
00:05:03.008 --> 00:05:07.893
"I'll just find a teenage girl and talk to her.

76
00:05:08.954 --> 00:05:10.655
That will keep Drew quiet!"

77
00:05:12.297 --> 00:05:15.119
Bobby and Jason bumped fists and chuckled.
